From f664c6a56bfc5c652d403432759dfdf45f71bb7d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: abtraore <abdrahtraore97@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 18:22:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] saturn: experimental PQ2_0 batch-1 GEMV
 (GGML_CUDA_PQ2_GEMV=1, default off), row-per-lane + K-chunks across warps,
 16-byte vector loads; correct to 1e-7 vs mmvq, currently slower (20.3 vs 17.0
 us on 5120x17408). Also the env-gated small_k geometry experiment (no
 effect).

---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmvq.cu      |  14 +++
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/pq2-gemv.cuh | 189 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 203 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/pq2-gemv.cuh

